        <div className="demo-alert demo-alert-tip">
          <div className="demo-alert-title">Nested boundary</div>
          <p>允许已经准备好的上层内容先显示，再独立等待慢子树。Boundary 应贴合设计中的 loading sequence。</p>
        </div>
